										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a> has a selection of LEGO sets on sale. Below are a few good options you can consider for today, November 10, 2026. As always, discounts and deals can change at any time.</p>
