<p>While all of these deals are great, I especially like the Camper Van set because it not only includes figures and accessories, but the van also opens up to reveal a living space with a kitchen, bunk beds, and more.</p>
<p>The Cat Birthday Party &amp; Tree House set is also one of my favorites, as it has several interactive features, including a piñata, plus numerous accessories and figures to play with and display.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
