		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114531</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="836" height="720" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND California Resort Hotel &amp; Ticket Package Bundle December 5-6, 2026" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026.jpg 836w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026-300x258.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026-768x661.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 836px) 100vw, 836px" /></p>
<p>If you are looking for fun filled family adventures, the three USA LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (California &#124;</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/2-days-left-save-big-on-legoland-california-florida-theme-park-hotel-tickets-package-bundle-extra-150-usd-off-at-checkout/">2 Days Left &#8211; Save Big on LEGOLAND California &#038; Florida Theme Park Hotel &#038; Tickets Package Bundle (Extra $150 USD Off at Checkout)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>If you are looking for fun filled family adventures, the three USA LEGOLAND Theme Park Resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York</a>) are the perfect getaway.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-105806 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cropped-LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Galacticoaster-March-2026-Opening-Galaxy-Roller-Coaster-Banner-Logo-Ad-2.jpg" alt="" width="1378" height="517" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cropped-LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Galacticoaster-March-2026-Opening-Galaxy-Roller-Coaster-Banner-Logo-Ad-2.jpg 1378w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cropped-LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Galacticoaster-March-2026-Opening-Galaxy-Roller-Coaster-Banner-Logo-Ad-2-300x113.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cropped-LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Galacticoaster-March-2026-Opening-Galaxy-Roller-Coaster-Banner-Logo-Ad-2-1024x384.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cropped-LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Galacticoaster-March-2026-Opening-Galaxy-Roller-Coaster-Banner-Logo-Ad-2-768x288.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1378px) 100vw, 1378px" /></a></p>
<p>We were looking at the prices for one of the theme park resorts (<a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a>) and there&#8217;s a lot included in the hotel and tickets package bundle. As an example, we put in 1 room with two adults and two kids (i.e both ages 10) and the dates chosen were December 5-6, 2026 (Weekend &#8211; Saturday to Sunday). Note that prices will be even cheaper if you choose weekdays or off-peak periods. Weekends are usually busier and cost more.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114532 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026.jpg" alt="" width="836" height="720" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026.jpg 836w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026-300x258.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Resort-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Bundle-December-5-6-2026-768x661.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 836px) 100vw, 836px" /></a></p>
<p>For example, with the weekend dates and options that we choose, the <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California Hotel Resort Packages</a> start at <strong>$837 USD</strong>. Meanwhile, the <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California Castle Hotel Package</a> start from<strong> $853 USD</strong>. These packages include 2 Day Regular Price Adult and Discounted Kids Tickets and 1 night at the LEGOLAND Castle Hotel. It gives you early park access, LEGOLAND Theme Park and SEA Life Aquarium too.</p>
<p>For example, if you pick the Castle Hotel base package of Knights &amp; Dragons Deluxe Room without any addons or extras, it is <strong>$853 USD</strong> plus tax (with resort fees already included). Kids will get their own sleeping area with a twin size bunk bed as well.</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114533 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Castle-Hotel-California-December-5-6-2026-Stay-Prices-Rooms.jpg" alt="" width="781" height="792" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Castle-Hotel-California-December-5-6-2026-Stay-Prices-Rooms.jpg 781w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Castle-Hotel-California-December-5-6-2026-Stay-Prices-Rooms-296x300.jpg 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Castle-Hotel-California-December-5-6-2026-Stay-Prices-Rooms-768x779.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 781px) 100vw, 781px" /></a></p>
<p>If you are wondering how much the total package would cost, it would be $853 + $53.64 tax = <strong>$906.64 USD</strong>. But wait, we have an exclusive limited time Toys N Bricks coupon code just for our readers where you can save even more.</p>
<p>You can get an extra <strong>$150 USD off on LEGOLAND California or Florida Hotels + Ticket Package Bundles</strong>. This is valid only for new bookings only and is <span style="text-decoration: underline;">not valid for their partner hotels</span>. Use our coupon code <strong>SANTA150</strong> at checkout to get this special promo offer at either the <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California Hotel &amp; Ticket Package Page</a> or <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida Hotel &amp; Ticket Package Page</a>. This means after using our coupon code, <span style="text-decoration: underline;">final price will be<strong> $756.64 USD</strong> with all taxes and fees included</span>. This is for a weekend in December. The example used was for the dates December 5-6, 2026 and assuming two adults and two children (aged 10). Feel free to play around with their booking system to choose your preferred dates (different prices for different dates) for staying at the hotel. (:</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114536 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Castle-Hotel-Booking-Example-December-5-6-2026-with-Coupon-Code-Toysnbricks.jpg" alt="" width="1185" height="813" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Castle-Hotel-Booking-Example-December-5-6-2026-with-Coupon-Code-Toysnbricks.jpg 1185w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Castle-Hotel-Booking-Example-December-5-6-2026-with-Coupon-Code-Toysnbricks-300x206.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Castle-Hotel-Booking-Example-December-5-6-2026-with-Coupon-Code-Toysnbricks-1024x703.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Castle-Hotel-Booking-Example-December-5-6-2026-with-Coupon-Code-Toysnbricks-768x527.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1185px) 100vw, 1185px" /></a></p>
<p>Our exclusive Toys N Bricks promo code offer runs from <strong>November 2-11, 2026</strong> which means there are only two days left to take advantage of this epic offer.</p>
<p><em>Shown below is the California Theme Park promo offers.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114075 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1251" height="760" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026.jpg 1251w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-300x182.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-1024x622.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-768x467.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1251px) 100vw, 1251px" /></a></p>
<p><em>Shown below is the Florida Theme Park promo offers.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114076 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026.jpg" alt="" width="1320" height="778" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026.jpg 1320w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-300x177.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-1024x604.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Florida-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Promo-Landing-Page-November-2026-768x453.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px" /></a></p>
<p>By booking a hotel package, you&#8217;ll get nightly kids&#8217; entertainment. You will also be steps away from the LEGOLAND theme park (no driving is needed!). California has the LEGOLAND Hotel (with themed rooms) and the LEGOLAND Castle Hotel. For Florida, they have the LEGOLAND Hotel (with themed rooms) and the Pirate Island Hotel. There is also the Beach Retreat too.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Book Now and See the LEGOLAND Hotel &amp; Ticket Package Promo Page (Save an Extra $150 USD with Toys N Bricks Coupon Code <span style="text-decoration: underline;">SANTA150</span>):</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a></li>
</ul>
<p><em>Shown below are some of the features of the California LEGOLAND Hotel</em></p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114077 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Features-Attractions-November-2026-Holiday-Christmas.jpg" alt="" width="1003" height="771" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Features-Attractions-November-2026-Holiday-Christmas.jpg 1003w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Features-Attractions-November-2026-Holiday-Christmas-300x231.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Hotel-Ticket-Package-Features-Attractions-November-2026-Holiday-Christmas-768x590.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1003px) 100vw, 1003px" /></a></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Book Now and See the LEGOLAND Hotel &amp; Ticket Package Promo Page (Save an Extra $150 USD with Toys N Bricks Coupon Code <span style="text-decoration: underline;">SANTA150</span>):</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fplaces-to-stay%2Fvacation-packages%2Fhotel-plus-ticket-package%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Florida</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114080 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Fireworks-2026.jpg" alt="" width="998" height="666" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Fireworks-2026.jpg 1080w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Fireworks-2026-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Fireworks-2026-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-California-Christmas-Bricktacular-Fireworks-2026-768x513.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 998px) 100vw, 998px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><em>If you don&#8217;t want to stay at the LEGOLAND hotels, there are other hotels near LEGOLAND as well &#8211; <b>Book Other Hotels &amp; Vacation Rentals Outside of LEGOLAND: </b></em><a href="https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-5112601-15734399" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Hotels.com</a> | <a href="https://vrbo.stay22.com/toysnbricks/tbod3hLoQ8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">VRBO</a></p>
<p><em><strong>Looking to get car rentals, flights or vacation packages to get to LEGOLAND?</strong> These reputable official travel sites allow you to purchase what you need:</em> <a href="https://expedia.com/affiliates/expedia-home.GpHMNqi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Expedia</a> | <a href="https://booking.stay22.com/toysnbricks/CCGw6vqmUn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Booking.com</a> | <a href="https://tripadvisor.stay22.com/toysnbricks/muM7xHVAH4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">TripAdvisor</a></p>
