										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5D2eb/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.merlinannualpass.co.uk%2Fbuy-passes%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114514 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="617" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-300x154.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-1024x527.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-Black-Friday-UK-United-Kingdom-November-2026-Sale-768x395.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></a></p>
<p>If you are from United Kingdom UK (England, Wales, Scotland and Northern Ireland) or if you are from Europe, Canada, United States or anywhere around the world that want to visit the UK, the <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5D2eb/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.merlinannualpass.co.uk%2Fbuy-passes%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Black Friday 2026 UK Merlin Annual Pass Deal</a> is now live! The deal runs from November 9 to December 6, 2026. There are three annual passes you can choose from and all three passes includes access to <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Theme Park in Windsor, United Kingdom</a> too! Whether its going to the Alton Towers, SEA LIFE or other top UK Britain attractions, you don&#8217;t want to miss out.</p>
<p>The basic essential annual pass is now £99 GBP (reg.£139 GBP). The gold pass is now £169 GBP (reg.£239 GBP) and the platinum pass is now £229 GBP (reg.£299 GBP).</p>
<p><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5D2eb/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.merlinannualpass.co.uk%2Fbuy-passes%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114515 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-UK-United-Kingdom-Annual-Pass-Black-Friday-2026-November-Deals-Essential-Gold-Platinum-Benefits-Features-for-Attractions.jpg" alt="" width="1228" height="765" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-UK-United-Kingdom-Annual-Pass-Black-Friday-2026-November-Deals-Essential-Gold-Platinum-Benefits-Features-for-Attractions.jpg 1228w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-UK-United-Kingdom-Annual-Pass-Black-Friday-2026-November-Deals-Essential-Gold-Platinum-Benefits-Features-for-Attractions-300x187.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-UK-United-Kingdom-Annual-Pass-Black-Friday-2026-November-Deals-Essential-Gold-Platinum-Benefits-Features-for-Attractions-1024x638.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Merlin-Entertainment-UK-United-Kingdom-Annual-Pass-Black-Friday-2026-November-Deals-Essential-Gold-Platinum-Benefits-Features-for-Attractions-768x478.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1228px) 100vw, 1228px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-105212 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="1135" height="402" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg 1902w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-300x106.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1024x362.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-768x272.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1536x543.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1135px) 100vw, 1135px" /></a></p>
