<p>Target.com US currently has all five of this year&#8217;s 2026 LEGO Advent Calendars on sale. They include Star Wars,</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-target-lego-holiday-christmas-advent-calendars-2026-on-sale-choose-from-star-wars-marvel-disney-princess-city-or-friends/">[US] Target LEGO Holiday Christmas Advent Calendars 2026 On Sale (Choose from Star Wars, Marvel, Disney Princess, City or Friends)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-40079 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="823" height="233" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner.jpg 1148w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-300x84.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/Target-Logo-Banner-1024x289.jpg 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a> currently has <a href="https://howl.link/0y53xcldk1884" target="_blank" rel="noopener">all five of this year&#8217;s 2026 LEGO Advent Calendars on sale</a>. They include Star Wars, Marvel, Disney Princess, City and Friends. The licensed ones are more expensive (Star Wars, Marvel and Disney Princess) while the non-licensed original themed ones are cheaper (City &amp; Friends). Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well.</strong></p>
<p><em>Thanks to forum member Marshallmario for alerting us of this deal <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3404-target-advent-calendars-30-off/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in our LEGO forum</a>!</em></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/0y53xcldk1884" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114506 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-2026-Christmas-Holiday-Advent-Calendars-Sales-Deals.jpg" alt="" width="885" height="825" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-2026-Christmas-Holiday-Advent-Calendars-Sales-Deals.jpg 885w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-2026-Christmas-Holiday-Advent-Calendars-Sales-Deals-300x280.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-November-2026-Christmas-Holiday-Advent-Calendars-Sales-Deals-768x716.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 885px) 100vw, 885px" /></a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you when we have more LEGO Sales &amp; Deals USA offers!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. </span></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
